Instrução: Modificar includes/class-crud.php, includes/class-session.php e includes/class-api.php para suportar coins_amount, coins_platform e total_price.

=== 1. includes/class-crud.php — create() ===

Localizar o array de campos no $wpdb->insert de create():
    'dme_ids' => wp_json_encode( $data['dme_ids'] ?? [] ),
    'adm_id'  => intval( $data['adm_id'] ?? get_current_user_id() ),

Substituir por:
    'dme_ids'        => wp_json_encode( $data['dme_ids'] ?? [] ),
    'coins_amount'   => intval( $data['coins_amount'] ?? 0 ),
    'coins_platform' => in_array( $data['coins_platform'] ?? '', ['ps','xbox','pc'], true ) ? $data['coins_platform'] : 'ps',
    'adm_id'         => intval( $data['adm_id'] ?? get_current_user_id() ),

No array de formatos correspondente, adicionar '%d' e '%s' antes do '%d' de adm_id:
    [ '%s', '%f', '%s', '%d', '%s', '%d' ]

=== 2. includes/class-crud.php — update() ===

Após o bloco:
    if ( isset( $data['dme_ids'] ) ) { $fields['dme_ids'] = wp_json_encode( $data['dme_ids'] ); $formats[] = '%s'; }

Adicionar:
    if ( isset( $data['coins_amount'] ) )   { $fields['coins_amount']   = intval( $data['coins_amount'] );                                                                                           $formats[] = '%d'; }
    if ( isset( $data['coins_platform'] ) ) { $fields['coins_platform'] = in_array( $data['coins_platform'], ['ps','xbox','pc'], true ) ? $data['coins_platform'] : 'ps'; $formats[] = '%s'; }

=== 3. includes/class-crud.php — get() ===

Após:
    $row['dme_ids'] = json_decode( $row['dme_ids'], true ) ?: [];

Adicionar:
    $row['coins_amount']   = intval(  $row['coins_amount']   ?? 0 );
    $row['coins_platform'] = (string)($row['coins_platform'] ?? 'ps');

=== 4. includes/class-crud.php — get_all() e get_by_adm() ===

Em ambos os métodos, dentro do array_map, após:
    $r['dme_ids'] = json_decode( $r['dme_ids'], true ) ?: [];

Adicionar:
    $r['coins_amount']   = intval(  $r['coins_amount']   ?? 0 );
    $r['coins_platform'] = (string)($r['coins_platform'] ?? 'ps');

=== 5. includes/class-crud.php — adicionar get_total_price() ===

Adicionar ao final da classe (antes do } de fechamento da classe):

    public static function get_total_price( array $pack ): float {
        $dme_price    = floatval( $pack['price']        ?? 0 );
        $coins_amount = intval(   $pack['coins_amount'] ?? 0 );
        if ( $coins_amount <= 0 ) return $dme_price;
        $platform    = in_array( $pack['coins_platform'] ?? '', ['ps','xbox','pc'], true ) ? $pack['coins_platform'] : 'ps';
        $coins_price = 0.0;
        if ( class_exists( 'CS_Core' ) ) {
            $calc        = CS_Core::calc( 'lance', $platform, $coins_amount );
            $coins_price = floatval( $calc['price'] ?? 0 );
        }
        return $dme_price + $coins_price;
    }

=== 6. includes/class-session.php — calculate_total() ===

Localizar:
    if ( $pack ) $total += floatval( $pack['price'] ) * intval( $qty );

Substituir por:
    if ( $pack ) $total += CC_Packs_CRUD::get_total_price( $pack ) * intval( $qty );

=== 7. includes/class-api.php — create_pack() ===

Localizar o array passado para CC_Packs_CRUD::create():
    'name'    => $body['name'],
    'price'   => $body['price'],
    'dme_ids' => $body['dme_ids'],
    'adm_id'  => get_current_user_id(),

Substituir por:
    'name'           => $body['name'],
    'price'          => $body['price'],
    'dme_ids'        => $body['dme_ids'],
    'coins_amount'   => intval( $body['coins_amount'] ?? 0 ),
    'coins_platform' => sanitize_text_field( $body['coins_platform'] ?? 'ps' ),
    'adm_id'         => get_current_user_id(),

=== 8. includes/class-api.php — get_packs() ===

Localizar:
    return new WP_REST_Response( [ 'data' => CC_Packs_CRUD::get_all() ], 200 );

Substituir por:
    $packs = array_map( function ( $pack ) {
        $pack['total_price'] = CC_Packs_CRUD::get_total_price( $pack );
        return $pack;
    }, CC_Packs_CRUD::get_all() );
    return new WP_REST_Response( [ 'data' => $packs ], 200 );

Verificação: (1) CRUD::create() insere coins_amount (%d) e coins_platform (%s). (2) CRUD::update() trata coins_amount e coins_platform quando presentes. (3) get(), get_all(), get_by_adm() normalizam coins_amount como int e coins_platform como string. (4) Método get_total_price() existe e usa CS_Core::calc quando a classe está disponível. (5) Session::calculate_total() usa CC_Packs_CRUD::get_total_price($pack). (6) API::create_pack() passa coins_amount e coins_platform. (7) API::get_packs() retorna total_price em cada pack.

