Instrução: Modificar admin/class-admin-page.php e admin/admin.js para exibir e coletar coins_amount e coins_platform.

=== 1. admin/class-admin-page.php — formulário ===

Em render_crud_mode(), localizar o bloco do campo cc-pack-price (que termina com </div>):
    <div class="cc-admin-field">
        <label for="cc-pack-price">Preço (R$)</label>
        <input type="number" id="cc-pack-price" name="price" step="0.01" min="0" required>
    </div>

Após o </div> de fechamento deste bloco, inserir:
    <div class="cc-admin-field">
        <label>Coins no Pack <small>(opcional)</small></label>
        <div class="cc-admin-coins-row">
            <input type="number" id="cc-pack-coins" name="coins_amount" min="0" step="100000" value="0" placeholder="0">
            <select id="cc-pack-coins-platform">
                <option value="ps">PS</option>
                <option value="xbox">Xbox</option>
                <option value="pc">PC</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div id="cc-coins-price-preview" class="cc-admin-coins-preview" style="display:none"></div>
    </div>

=== 2. admin/class-admin-page.php — localize ===

Em enqueue_assets(), no array passado para wp_localize_script( 'cc-packs-admin', 'ccPacksAdmin', [...] ), adicionar o campo:
    'csCalcUrl' => rest_url( 'coins-selector/v1/calc' ),

=== 3. admin/admin.js — variáveis no topo ===

Após as linhas:
    var feedCache      = null;
    var allFeedItems   = [];

Adicionar:
    var coinsDebounce = null;
    var csCalcUrl     = (window.ccPacksAdmin && ccPacksAdmin.csCalcUrl) ? ccPacksAdmin.csCalcUrl : null;

=== 4. admin/admin.js — cancel handler ===

Dentro do handler de $cancel.on('click', ...), junto aos outros campos resetados, adicionar:
    $('#cc-pack-coins').val('0');
    $('#cc-pack-coins-platform').val('ps');
    $('#cc-coins-price-preview').hide().text('');

=== 5. admin/admin.js — save handler ===

Em $save.on('click', ...), após:
    var price = parseFloat($('#cc-pack-price').val());

Adicionar:
    var coinsAmount   = parseInt($('#cc-pack-coins').val())        || 0;
    var coinsPlatform = $('#cc-pack-coins-platform').val()         || 'ps';

Na definição de var data = { ... }, adicionar os dois campos:
    var data = { name: name, price: price, dme_ids: selectedDmeIds.slice(), coins_amount: coinsAmount, coins_platform: coinsPlatform };

=== 6. admin/admin.js — edit handler ===

Em $list.on('click', '.cc-edit-pack', ...), após:
    $('#cc-pack-price').val(pack.price);

Adicionar:
    $('#cc-pack-coins').val(pack.coins_amount || 0);
    $('#cc-pack-coins-platform').val(pack.coins_platform || 'ps');
    triggerCoinsPreview();

=== 7. admin/admin.js — loadPacks(), card HTML ===

Em loadPacks(), dentro do packs.forEach, localizar:
    var price = parseFloat(pack.price).toFixed(2).replace('.', ',');

Substituir por:
    var price = parseFloat(pack.total_price || pack.price).toFixed(2).replace('.', ',');

Após:
    '    <span class="cc-admin-pack-card-count">' + (pack.dme_ids ? pack.dme_ids.length : 0) + ' DMEs</span>' +

Adicionar:
    (pack.coins_amount > 0 ? '    <span class="cc-admin-pack-card-coins">\uD83E\uDE99\u00A0' + formatCoins(pack.coins_amount) + '\u00A0(' + (pack.coins_platform || 'ps').toUpperCase() + ')</span>' : '') +

=== 8. admin/admin.js — funções formatCoins e triggerCoinsPreview ===

Dentro de initCrud(), antes da chamada loadPacks() no final, adicionar as duas funções:

    function formatCoins(n) {
        n = parseInt(n) || 0;
        if (n <= 0) return '0';
        if (n >= 1000000) {
            var kk = n / 1000000;
            return (kk === Math.floor(kk) ? kk.toFixed(0) : kk.toFixed(1)) + 'kk';
        }
        return Math.floor(n / 1000) + 'k';
    }

    function triggerCoinsPreview() {
        clearTimeout(coinsDebounce);
        var coins    = parseInt($('#cc-pack-coins').val()) || 0;
        var platform = $('#cc-pack-coins-platform').val() || 'ps';
        var $preview = $('#cc-coins-price-preview');
        if (coins <= 0 || !csCalcUrl) { $preview.hide().text(''); return; }
        $preview.show().text('Calculando...');
        coinsDebounce = setTimeout(function () {
            var url = csCalcUrl + '?mode=lance&platform=' + encodeURIComponent(platform) + '&coins=' + coins;
            fetch(url, { headers: { 'X-WP-Nonce': nonce } })
                .then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
                .then(function (data) {
                    if (data && data.price_formatted) {
                        $preview.text('\uD83E\uDE99 Preço dos coins: ' + data.price_formatted).show();
                    } else {
                        $preview.hide().text('');
                    }
                })
                .catch(function () { $preview.hide().text(''); });
        }, 450);
    }

=== 9. admin/admin.js — listener de coins ===

Imediatamente após as funções do item 8, adicionar:
    $(document).on('input change', '#cc-pack-coins, #cc-pack-coins-platform', triggerCoinsPreview);

Verificação: (1) Form tem input#cc-pack-coins, select#cc-pack-coins-platform e div#cc-coins-price-preview. (2) wp_localize_script inclui csCalcUrl. (3) Variáveis coinsDebounce e csCalcUrl declaradas. (4) Cancel reseta campos de coins. (5) Save inclui coins_amount e coins_platform no payload. (6) Edit preenche campos de coins e chama triggerCoinsPreview. (7) Card usa total_price e exibe span de coins quando coins_amount > 0. (8) formatCoins e triggerCoinsPreview definidos. (9) Listener de input/change em #cc-pack-coins e #cc-pack-coins-platform.
